{"text": "Now seven people were running. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind Simpleton and his goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon they came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a city. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a king and a princess. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The princess was so serious. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That she never laughed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Anyone who makes her laugh. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Can marry her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The princess saw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The funny line of people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And laughed and laughed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton asked to marry her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the king did not like him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> First, bring me a man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who can drink a whole cellar of wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton went back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the place of the old tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There a man was sitting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a very sad face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am so thirsty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And water is not enough for me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The man drank and drank. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Until every barrel was empty.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "o", "w", " ", "s", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "r", "u", "n", "n", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "o", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "a", " ", "c", 